+// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright 2026 shadPS4 Emulator Project
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+
+// vcore: host side of the GPU hang guard (shader_recompiler/loop_guard.h): the report buffer
+// that guarded shaders and the indirect-argument clamp write into, a thread that logs its
